# Report format ↔ sample reports (always sync)

When adjusting **either** report product UI or content rules, **always update both sample fixtures in the same change**:

| Product | Live UI | Sample source | Preview URL |
|---------|---------|---------------|-------------|
| Job Fit Snapshot | `components/LiteReportDashboard.tsx` (+ lite prompts/normalize) | `lib/sample-reports.ts` → `getSampleSnapshotReport()` | `/samples?type=job_fit_snapshot` |
| Interview Strategy Guide | `components/FullReportDashboard.tsx` (+ full prompts/normalize) | `lib/sample-reports.ts` → `getSampleStrategyGuideReport()` | `/samples?type=interview_strategy_guide` |

## Checklist (do not skip)

1. Change report layout, copy rules, fields shown/hidden, or Score Summary / Range Evaluation / Beagle Scale behavior.
2. Update **both** sample payloads in `lib/sample-reports.ts` so `/samples` still looks like production.
3. If Strategy Guide embeds Snapshot, ensure Guide sample’s Snapshot layer matches the Snapshot sample rules.
4. Run/adjust `__tests__/unit/sample-reports.test.ts` if structure changes.
5. Commit samples with the UI/prompt change — never leave samples stale for “later”.

## Current Snapshot content rules (as of 2026-07-18)

- **Layout**: one-page slide frame (`LiteReportDashboard`) — single outer border; internal sections use dividers, not separate floating cards. No upgrade CTA under the slide.
- **Score Summary**: fit evaluation only (why match / why not). No Apply/Next resume coaching.
- **Range Evaluation**: plain-language **market value of the role**, not evidence-tier glossary.
- **Beagle Scale**: hidden by default; popover appears when hovering / focusing / tapping the fit-score circle only.
- JobBeagle evaluates fit — it is **not** a resume coach.
- Strategy Guide embeds the same Snapshot slide frame; keep Guide chrome consistent when Snapshot layout changes.
- Homepage `ReferralCard` is referral-only (credits live on `/account`).
